WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.894 --> 00:00:19.702
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.702 --> 00:00:26.991
Tap Instructor, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:26.991 --> 00:00:30.179
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.179 --> 00:00:34.413
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.413 --> 00:00:40.412
Type your six digits.

6
00:00:40.412 --> 00:00:45.781
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.781 --> 00:00:51.359
This is the Instructor Panel. Five tabs across the top.

8
00:00:51.359 --> 00:00:57.553
Every correction and every reset is written down automatically.

9
00:00:57.553 --> 00:01:03.373
Open the Log tab.

10
00:01:03.373 --> 00:01:09.899
Newest first: who, which day, and when it was changed.

11
00:01:09.899 --> 00:01:16.849
Nothing here can be edited or deleted — not even by an instructor.

12
00:01:16.849 --> 00:01:24.600
That is what makes the attendance record worth trusting.
